    "predispatch_failure": "STRUCTURALLY_UNDERPOWERED_REFUSE"
  },
  "selection_algorithm": [
    "Parse the source-pool lock as UTF-8 JSON and reject duplicate candidate_id or source_structure_id values.",
    "Require every listed field and eligibility rule; reject the whole materialization on a missing, null, contradictory, or unverified value.",
    "Remove candidates whose source_structure_id occurs in any excluded prior panel; no fuzzy identity substitution is allowed.",
    "Form strata by the exact four-field grouping_tuple. Discard strata with fewer than five eligible candidates.",
    "For each candidate compute rank = lowercase_hex(SHA256(seed + U+0000 + class + U+0000 + chemistry + U+0000 + structure_prototype + U+0000 + composition_space_neighbourhood + U+0000 + source_structure_id)).",
    "Within each stratum sort by (rank, source_structure_id), both ascending bytewise UTF-8.",
    "For each class sort strata by lowercase_hex(SHA256(seed + U+0000 + class + U+0000 + chemistry + U+0000 + structure_prototype + U+0000 + composition_space_neighbourhood)), then by the four tuple fields ascending bytewise UTF-8.",
    "For each class solve exactly for one selected occupancy per ordered stratum: occupancy is zero or an integer from five through that stratum's eligible capacity, and the occupancies must sum exactly to the class quota.",
    "Among feasible occupancy vectors choose deterministically by allocation_contract.objective_order; exact integer dynamic programming is required and a heuristic or greedy fallback is forbidden.",
    "If no feasible occupancy vector exists, REFUSE; do not transfer quota across classes, underfill a used stratum, or relax eligibility.",
    "From each used stratum select the first occupancy candidates in frozen within-stratum order.",
    "Before emission, verify every selected structure has at least four other selected structures in its exact grouping tuple with provenance-accepted references for every confirmatory property, and verify at least 16 such distinct structures per class and property without reading model outputs; otherwise STRUCTURALLY_UNDERPOWERED_REFUSE.",
    "Concatenate ionics-rocksalt then perovskites, assign panel_index 0 through 124, and emit canonical JSON sorted by panel_index.",
    "The output must contain exactly 63 ionics-rocksalt plus 62 perovskite structures and exactly 125 unique candidate_id and source_structure_id values."
  ],
